# Oracle: VD dev-builtin-mutual (no terminals; k 0 by default; ind1, ind2 the inductors by
# instance name) and run src-mutual (`print instance` of a mutual with no k: k = 0). The
# inductors are the devices area's; a by-name reference is not bound.
# codes:
file "mutual.sim" deck
  title "mutual"
  model m mutual
  element coupling m1 () model=m inductors=(l1 l2) k=0.95
  element coupling m2 () model=m inductors=(l1 l3) k=0
